& [Stage7] is publication and next-slice review
  + [action] review support_delta and requirement_delta
  + [action] commit and push the pure revision as one intentional checkpoint
  + [action] update the external conversation/reentry surface
  + [action] select M2B work only from remaining dependency-ready, separately governed gates

& [StopConditions] are fail-closed
  + [authority_fault] stops implementation
  + [unexpected_consumer] stops legacy rejection until compatibility is reprocessed
  + [dependency_or_effect_delta] stops and requires a new source
  + [test_or_evidence_contradiction] stops publication and triggers local rework
